{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkspFwJuvJxmfegxH1vn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Comparing kupat gemel lehashkaa tracks: my notes as a 24-year-old first-timer\n\n## 1. What I'd do, and how sure I am\n\nI'd pick an **\"עוקב מדד S&P 500\"** track, because that's the \"invest in the S&P 500\" advice I keep hearing. Every company has one, and they look almost the same. The returns over 3 years are all about 13.3% to 13.9%, and their ring charts are full (\"מניות 99%\"). So the only real difference I could see was the fee under \"דמי ניהול… מהחיסכון\".\n\nThese are the cheapest S&P 500 tracks I found:\n\n| Company | Track no. | Fee (savings) | Fee (deposit) | 3 years | 5 years |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| מנורה מבטחים | 13874 | 0.52% | 0.01% | 13.79% | \"פחות מ־5 שנים\" |\n| אלטשולר שחם | 14865 | 0.54% | 0% | \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" | none |\n| הראל | 13414 | 0.56% | 0% | 13.7% | 11.92% |\n| אנליסט | 13854 | 0.56% | 0% | 13.44% | none |\n| מגדל | 13563 | 0.57% | \"עוד לא דווח\" | 13.65% | 12.07% |\n\n**I'd probably go with Harel 13414.** It's nearly the cheapest, it has 5 years of history, and it's the biggest company. Menora is 0.04% cheaper, but I don't understand the extra 0.01% \"מההפקדה\".\n\n**How sure am I? About 60%.** I'm fairly sure an S&P 500 track is the right kind for me. I'm not sure the fee is the only thing that matters, or that 0.5% is a good price. I have nothing to compare it to.\n\n## 2. Parts of the page I actually used\n\n- The intro under **\"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\"**, which told me what the numbers mean and their dates.\n- The product buttons, where **\"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\"** was already selected.\n- The **\"במה הכסף מושקע\"** chips. Seeing **\"עוקב מדד s&p 500 12\"** told me every company has one. In real life I'd click it so only those 12 show.\n- The sorting note: \"בתוך כל חברה לפי דמי הניהול מהחיסכון, מהזול ליקר\".\n- The table: the track names, the fee column and the 3/5-year returns.\n- The note at the bottom: \"התשואה… לפני דמי הניהול ולפני מס… ולכן אין מיון לפיה\".\n\n## 3. Block by block\n\n- **Top menu** (\"מדריך\", \"חוקים וכללים\", \"השוואה למטרה\" and the rest): skipped. \"השוואה למטרה\" sounded tempting, but I stayed on this page.\n- **\"לפי מוצר / לפי חברה\" tabs:** skimmed them and didn't touch them.\n- **Title and intro:** used. \"דמי הניהול הם הממוצע שנגבה בפועל ב־2025\" was useful.\n- **\"123 מקור 123 מחושב 123 הזנה לחצו על מספר כדי לראות מאיפה הוא\":** confused me. I didn't get what \"הזנה\" means or why I'd care.\n- **Orange box, \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\":** read it. It made me a bit worried, but the data is only a month or two old, so I went on.\n- **Product buttons:** used, just to confirm I was on the right product. I don't know what \"קרן השתלמות\" or \"קרן חדשה מקיפה\" are, and I didn't need to.\n- **\"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" link:** noticed it and would probably click it later.\n- **\"קיבוץ לפי: חברה / במה הכסף מושקע\":** I'd guess \"במה הכסף מושקע\" puts all the S&P 500 tracks together. That would have saved me a lot of scrolling.\n- **Search box:** skipped.\n- **Filter chips:** used the S&P 500 one. I didn't understand most of the others: \"אג\"ח\", \"סחיר\", \"גמיש\", \"קיימות\", \"הלכה יהודית/איסלאמית\", \"כספי (שקלי)\".\n- **The table, roughly 140 rows over 7 screens:** I scrolled the whole thing, but I only really read the S&P 500 rows and the grey company header rows. I skimmed the rest.\n- **Grey company rows** (e.g. \"הראל 16 מסלולים · נכסים 19.1 מיליארד ₪ · דמי ניהול מהחיסכון: מ־0.54% עד 0.61%\"): skimmed. They helped me see that big companies don't charge much more.\n- **Bottom notes:** read them. I was relieved to learn that \"עוד לא דווח\" just means the data is missing.\n- **Footer** (\"אתר אישי, לא מסחרי, בלי קישורי שיווק\"): read it, and it made me trust the page a bit more.\n\n## 4. Inside the table\n\n- **Columns I looked at:**\n  - The track name.\n  - \"דמי ניהול… מהחיסכון\". This was my main column.\n  - \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\" for 3 years (\"3 שנים\") and 5 years (\"5 שנים\").\n- **Columns I mostly ignored:**\n  - \"קופה\", which is just a number to me.\n  - \"מההפקדה\", because it's almost always \"0%\".\n  - \"נכסים בסוף ספטמבר 2026\". I used it a little: \"2.3 מיליארד ₪\" felt safer than \"2 מיליון ₪\".\n  - The \">\" arrows. I never clicked one.\n- **Ring chart and colours:** I only used the general idea. Teal \"מניות\" and yellow \"מט\"ח\", and a full ring means \"all in\". I didn't really understand the yellow part.\n- **Grey labels:** I noticed the \"חדש\" tags and the little grey labels like \"עוקב מדדי אג\"ח\" and \"הלכה יהודית\", and ignored them.\n- **Orange \"!\" with \"עוד לא דווח\":** noticed. Together with \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", it made me skip the newer tracks, like all of איילון's.\n- **Dotted underlines:** I guess they're clickable. I didn't try.\n\n## 5. What I didn't understand\n\n- **\"מט\"ח\"**, and why an S&P 500 track shows \"מט\"ח 99%\".\n- **\"אג\"ח\"**, \"סחיר\", \"גמיש\", \"משולב\".\n- **\"מהחיסכון\" vs \"מההפקדה\"**: why are there two fees, and which one hurts more?\n- **\"מניות 101%\"**: how is that more than 100%?\n- **The Ayalon S&P 500 track** (15977) shows \"מניות 34%\" and \"מט\"ח 82%\". Isn't an S&P 500 track supposed to be all stocks?\n- **\"עוקב מדדי מניות\" vs \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" vs \"מניות\"**: what's the difference?\n- **\"לפני דמי הניהול\"**: so do I subtract about 0.55% from the 13.7% myself?\n\n## 6. What I wanted and couldn't find\n\n- Is 0.5% a good fee? Can I ask a company for a lower one?\n- How do I actually open one, and is there a minimum amount or a monthly deposit?\n- When can I take the money out, and what tax do I pay?\n- A simple example, like \"if I put in ₪1,000 a month for 10 years…\".\n- Can I move later to another company or another track?\n- A one-click way to see only the S&P 500 tracks, sorted by fee across all companies, instead of grouped by company.\n\n## 7. If half the page had to go\n\n1. **Remove first:** most of the rows. All the bond, money-market and \"הלכה\" tracks could go behind the filter.\n2. Then the \"123 מקור/מחושב/הזנה\" line.\n3. Then the \"קופה\" number column, and \"מההפקדה\" when it's 0%.\n4. Then the \"נכסים\" column.\n5. **Keep:** the track name, the fee from savings, the 3/5-year returns, and the S&P 500 filter."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":25637,"cache_read_input_tokens":3665,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":25637},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"93fbf909-1911-4394-b6ee-ec609d5f1f40","uuid":"f2bcfe93-471d-4042-908e-876bcecb71b0","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:22:33.803Z","request_id":"req_011CgkspECthueYnckctEbbL"}
